      "created_at": "2021-02-03T02:59:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So we were theorycrafting and ran into some strange language.&nbsp; Volatile Creations is clearly meant for your minions, but it also references Boosts and Hinders being destroyed.&nbsp; So our question is this:&nbsp; Does a Boost or Hinder get \"destroyed\" when it's used?&nbsp; Or only when someone counter-Mods or Overcomes it?</p>",
