      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/f475e1/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2021-02-03T21:24:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I feel like it's not a big deal to just let Volatile Creations activate when the mod is expended; you're bottlenecked by number of reactions in any case.</p>",
